        "visual": "Documentation route exists; a dedicated visual fixture remains a tracked rollout gap."
      },
      "limitations": [
        "Single selection only.",
        "Only two and three-column layouts are supported.",
        "No built-in invalid or error state.",
        "No native form-submission value."
